{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_020meg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_002_1000_p", "source_sha256": "eff890f3e8c35b4ec6f294047613a4e4035924a92b0898422e14c6f3a72b45e8", "ja": "（これから宣材写真の撮影なのに、\n待ち合わせ場所に恵美の姿がない……）", "zh": "（等一下就要拍摄宣传照了，\n约好的碰头地点却没看见惠美……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_020meg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_002_1001_p", "source_sha256": "c06fb0a17b9ee6cae644ce25ea54533de2f70245fa0eb88d3eed4a8b3e1fe206", "ja": "（受付の人に聞いたら、どうやら先にスタジオに\n入ったらしい。何かあったのかな？）", "zh": "（问了柜台的人，她似乎已经先进去摄影棚了。\n是有什么状况吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_020meg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_002_1002_020meg", "source_sha256": "ce7bb1017722b0e11b3f6f53fb1576d8ba635d8ee37dd7ce3d88c61a4f1c8072", "ja": "あ、{$P$}！\nこっちこっち～！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n这边这边～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_020meg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_002_1003_p", "source_sha256": "c02011424e082572d7b086365cc89c6eb893865c408bd6bcdf3bb64a79bf25df", "ja": "恵美！　よかった……\n何かあったのかと思って、心配したよ。", "zh": "惠美！太好了……\n我还以为有什么状况，很担心呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_020meg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_002_1004_020meg", "source_sha256": "bbebafc4ed1b0dfcd7c78e2af637702d661026ef8ca5b49f07f087cb7dfc78a8", "ja": "ごめん、ごめん。\nちょっと用事があってさ、先に入っちゃったんだ。", "zh": "抱歉抱歉。\n我有点事要做，就先进来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_020meg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_002_1005_p", "source_sha256": "33727530710b0958644d70e2ffc80691b6e7ca018e47f227f62b4b4a3e42ff8f", "ja": "なるほど。\nところで、用事って……何かあったのか？", "zh": "原来如此。\n话说回来，你说有事要做……是怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_020meg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_002_1006_020meg", "source_sha256": "3706cc94a5821971224f4cb634bf3f3a58b55a4e4b21c63d9a4bb8cd93f6f1a9", "ja": "うん！　昨日事務所でさ、アタシと同じ、\n今日が撮影だって子達と話してたんだけど……", "zh": "嗯！昨天我在事务所的时候，\n跟几个同样是今天拍照的女孩聊了天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_020meg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_002_1007_020meg", "source_sha256": "dfbde3ac422abd3c85ae56a35d969e8cab1667112b4cc588f2687644a3bd5632", "ja": "みんな初めてで、緊張してるって言うからさ！\n色々教えたげようと思って。", "zh": "大家都说第一次拍照很紧张，所以啊！\n我才想说教她们一些东西。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_020meg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_002_1008_p", "source_sha256": "052575d82ea0d05de646fe038644acf096e8104c0d6ac2a4e98ffb73c5e276f0", "ja": "教えるって、何を？", "zh": "你说教她们，是教什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_020meg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_002_1009_020meg", "source_sha256": "828ba75103c00d90cf92485c275b9ae7bef4a4ef5d215324cb8a91734328edd2", "ja": "どんなポーズが写真映えするか～、とか、\nカメラマンさんがよく言うのはこんなコトで～、とか？", "zh": "像是什么姿势拍起来好看啊～\n还有摄影师常说的那句话是这个意思啊～之类的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_020meg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_002_1010_p", "source_sha256": "9d8e26a552122426fdba52bfe3bc0d4b49fe80749e2f2863c5e6f476832c1af3", "ja": "そうか……\n恵美は、読者モデルの経験があったな。", "zh": "对耶……\n惠美有当读者模特儿的经验呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_020meg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_002_1011_020meg", "source_sha256": "29cd6c790d4d8e093f204204925a8e0996b79ca5d2bf3b2a9e23395a6bed62ff", "ja": "うん！\nアタシの知ってるコトが、役に立つならと思って。", "zh": "嗯！\n想说要是我会的东西能派上用场就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_020meg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_002_1012_p", "source_sha256": "84bee3c82cac9f494444a6d97b3ace4c1ee49ee0969d2c76490fdc14be8faddc", "ja": "ああ、すごく役に立ったと思うよ。\nありがとな、恵美。", "zh": "是呀，一定非常有帮助。\n谢谢你，惠美。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_020meg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_002_1013_020meg", "source_sha256": "c5d3bce8dd41357509f17ef47bfdc0123c4fdc5641921bb7109e3eed39111fec", "ja": "いいって～。\nそれより、ナイショなんだけど……。", "zh": "不会啦～\n比起这个，有件事你要帮我保密……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_020meg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_002_1014_p", "source_sha256": "e1d825864acb2300c0f937c5827cd59ff49c1297974d53460879691abbce3e42", "ja": "ん？", "zh": "嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_020meg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_002_1015_020meg", "source_sha256": "62e17ddc781c3c8c460cac3fb91e903370adae4530c3d22dae9a0ff846d65ccc", "ja": "みんなには、カッコつけて教えてたけど……\n実はアタシも、緊張してるんだよね～！", "zh": "虽然我一副很懂的样子在教大家……\n但其实我也在紧张呀～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_020meg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_002_1016_p", "source_sha256": "a21416ed215c7ea92214c0f36a7c4793328804be732d3d3593bcfd15b8706320", "ja": "えっ……そうなのか？", "zh": "咦……是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_020meg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_002_1017_020meg", "source_sha256": "23a789f0613ca4723cccc88796e58d8731c3781d0def0cd5ca4d14328755c880", "ja": "うん！　だって読モはやったコトあるけど、\nアイドルの撮影なんて初めてだからさ～。", "zh": "嗯！因为我虽然当过读者模特儿，\n但还是第一次拍偶像的照片～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_020meg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_002_1018_020meg", "source_sha256": "0c9a9a83fa4eaae48f7f5959ead23dd0fe3b8c55d3647551c1499ff69f70d0ff", "ja": "こう見えて、すっごくドキドキしてるんだよ！\nうまくできるかな～って。", "zh": "别看我这样，我现在心可是跳得很快呢！\n一直在想自己能不能拍好～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_020meg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_002_1019_p", "source_sha256": "8300a28d1e126fa9b536d5e9322d115961b1e3f680a5e5d99e4dee4a392d533d", "ja": "それもそうか……。恵美も緊張してるのに、\nみんなの相談に乗ってくれたんだな。ありがとう。", "zh": "那倒也是……惠美你明明也会紧张，\n还帮忙给大家建议，真的很谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_020meg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_002_1020_020meg", "source_sha256": "9df623310347f50111929f729122ca59b60b84ad1172a47256fa96303cce4fa1", "ja": "だ、だから～！\nお礼とか、そういうのはいいってば～。", "zh": "都、都跟你说过了～！\n道谢之类的话就免了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_020meg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_002_1021_020meg", "source_sha256": "c2e6fee9822172e1659fd1ddd8ce76702e52154b4908c27138c19861b2b92a2e", "ja": "でも緊張はしてるけど、これも大事なお仕事だし！\nアタシなりに頑張るよ、ってね♪", "zh": "不过，虽然会紧张，但这也是重要的工作！\n我会用自己的方式好好努力的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_020meg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_002_1022_p", "source_sha256": "c01865a71a5a4d298e1e051b7795ebe41156a57c1ec361c376da27647aa275ed", "ja": "うん、そうだな。", "zh": "嗯，你说得对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_020meg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_002_1023_020meg", "source_sha256": "2ca37cdb09733a49198eba2b744df9377f4491d54b32566adde6fc15385205cb", "ja": "アタシを選んでくれた{$P$}とか……\n応援してくれてるコたちのためにも、ね♪", "zh": "这也是为了选择我的{$P$}……\n和支持着我的人们嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_020meg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_002_1024_020meg", "source_sha256": "cf835b4cf5c065875841ba3fb28d82977d6e09aae90db7c5bd4868b861226d65", "ja": "……なんて、ガラにもなく真面目なコト\n言っちゃったかな？　にゃははっ♪", "zh": "……哎呀，这些话好像太认真，\n不像我的作风吧？呀哈哈♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_020meg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_002_1025_p", "source_sha256": "bb7b347c2c2de352ed40d3f1a34e7934be99cd8280b6c549d9e8b61bab0788c3", "ja": "（恵美は、案外面倒見がいいんだな。\n友達のことも、大事にしてるみたいだし……）", "zh": "（惠美意外地很会照顾人呢。\n而且她似乎也很重视朋友……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_020meg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_002_1026_020meg", "source_sha256": "e379e0c16a4731911c95a7f9c4904fca43c8a850267ad56fc44ba5b225191eb9", "ja": "{$P$}。アタシ、\nみんなの期待に応えられるように頑張るからさ……。", "zh": "{$P$}，\n我会为了回应大家的期待，努力加油的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_020meg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_002_1027_020meg", "source_sha256": "d731dad4a1db2215a113a7ffa3eac541c3ef94fb97c590fccc112e84512e8b9c", "ja": "撮影、ちゃんと見ててよね♪", "zh": "你要好好看着我拍照喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_020meg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_002_1028_p", "source_sha256": "e672eaf748fc830f7f88f6eda137c1735878382e9e64e2433a3d81d0042bdae1", "ja": "ああ、任せておけ！", "zh": "嗯，包在我身上！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_020meg_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_020meg_002_1029_p", "source_sha256": "cd632d7b309e345e7e53185cfd4f3f834e43cb2281cf5ab4dda45558e2161135", "ja": "（経験とセンス、何よりその気持ちが、恵美の魅力を\n際立たせている……。今後の活動も楽しみだ！）", "zh": "（拥有经验和判断力，最重要的是还有那份心，这些都让\n惠美的魅力更上一层楼……真期待她之后的偶像活动！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
